-- ============================================================================
-- Arathi Catch-Up / RPE -- the missing GAMEOBJECT layer  (2026-08-22)
-- ============================================================================
-- Map 2927 had ZERO gameobjects spawned -- no doodads, no props, no interactables at all -- which also
-- left quest 90893's gameobject objective (461756: 13x Catapult Supplies 542836) unsatisfiable.
-- The rig's gameobject create-block decoder (objupdate_gospawn, --gospawns) had simply never been run
-- for this zone. Running it against BOTH captures and unioning by entry+position (deduped 3 yd) yields
-- the rows below: 205 spawns over 177 entries. The one observed entry with no gameobject_template on this
-- realm (541787) is skipped rather than spawned as a broken reference.
--
-- Phasing: scenery stays on PhaseId 0 (visible in every phase, like the terrain it dresses). The one
-- quest-relevant entry, Catapult Supplies 542836, goes on the siege phase 28 (gated 90888 rewarded AND
-- NOT 90896 -- exactly the 90893 window) with a short respawn, so the 13 required pickups can be
-- gathered from the 6 captured crates.
-- Rotation is the standard yaw quaternion derived from the captured orientation.

DELETE FROM `gameobject` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 8100000 AND 8109999;
